      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef findMissingAndRepeatedValues(grid):\n    n = len(grid)\n    total_numbers = n * n\n    expected_sum = total_numbers * (total_numbers + 1) // 2\n    actual_sum = 0\n    seen = set()\n    repeated = 0\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(n):\n            num = grid[i][j]\n            actual_sum += num\n            if num in seen:\n                repeated = num\n            else:\n                seen.add(num)\n    \n    missing = expected_sum - (actual_sum - repeated)\n    return [repeated, missing]\n```",
